  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "41",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o gatano na kabere ase omwaka oria, Isumaeli mosinto o Netania, mochokoro bw’Elisama, oyorenge omonto bw’enyomba y’obogambi na omoteneneri omonene igoro ase abanene barenge gokorera omorwoti, amo nabaanto bande ikomi, bagacha ase Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, agwo Misipa. Ekero barenge koria endagera amo bonsi agwo Misipa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, amo nabaanto baria ikomi barenge komo, bagatenena bagaaka Gedalia mosinto bw’Ahikamu, mochokoro o Safani, n’omoro, bakamoita. (Gedalia oria omorwoti o Babiloni konya abekire koba omogabana ase ense eria.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Isumaeli agaita Abayahudi bonsi barenge amo na Gedalia agwo Misipa, agaita nabasikari b’Abakalidayo abwo banyorekanete bare aase agwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere Gedalia gaitirwe, na monto onde konya taramanya amang’ana ayio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanto emerongo etano na etato bakarua Sekemu, na Silo, na Samaria, bakagenda ase enyomba y’Omonene, babwate okoruegwa kw’endagera na ubani. Abanto abwo nigo bagingerete chinderu chiabo, na batandorete chianga chiabo, na emebere yabo nigo yakeba‐kebire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, agacha korwa Misipa gocha kobarotota okorera. Ekero aumeranete nabarabwo, akabateebia, “Inchuo ase Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto abwo basoete ase omochie, Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, amo nabaanto bande barenge komo, bagaita abanto abwo, erio bakaruta emebere yabo ime ase engoro yakunyire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende mbarengeo abanto ikomi ase abwo, baabateebeetie Isumaeli, “Totoita, ntobwate engano, na esairi na amaguta, na obooke, tokabisete ase emegondo.” Ase ayio akabatiga, tabaita ekero aitete baria bande bamwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engoro eria ase Isumaeli atugutete emebere yonsi y’abanto baria aitete, nigo yarenge eria Asa omorwoti akunyete gotanga Baasa, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, tarwania omochie; korende bono Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, akayeichoria nemebere y’abanto baitetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Isumaeli akaira ase obosomba abanto batigarete agwo Misipa, akaira nabaiseke b’omorwoti, na abanto bonsi batigarete, abwo Nebusaradani, omochiki bw’abarendi, atigete ase okoboko kwa Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu. Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, akabaira ase obosomba, akagenda gochia ase ense y’Abaamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, amo nabatang’ani b’abasikari bonsi barenge amo nere, baigwete amang’ana ayio amabe, Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, akorete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakagenda amo nabasikari babo bonsi komorwania. Bakamochiera, bakamonyora ase ritibo rinene agwo Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto bonsi, abwo Isumaeli airete, baroche Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, amo nabatang’ani b’abasikari, bakaba nomogooko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo abwo bonsi Isumaeli konya arusirie Misipa na kobaira ase obosomba, bakairana, bagacha ase Yohanani, mosinto o Karea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, amo nabaanto bande batano na batato, bagatama korwa ase Yohanani, bakagenda ase Abaamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yohanani, mosinto o Karea, amo nabatang’ani b’abasikari, abarenge amo nere, bakairana korwa Gibeoni abanto abatigari, abasikari, na abakungu, na abana, na abasomba, abwo Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, arusetie Misipa, ekero aitete Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda, bakabeera ase enyomba y’abageni agwo Kimuhamu, ang’e na Bethlehemu, na korwa aroro mbaganetie kogenda ase ense ya Misiri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo boboete Abakalidayo, ekiagera Isumaeli, mosinto o Netania, konya oitire Gedalia, mosinto bw’Ahikamu, oyio omorwoti o Babiloni konya abekire koba omogabana ase ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
